/**
 * The company mark, identical to the one on notorganic.info: a rounded
 * teardrop rotated 45 degrees. It is drawn in CSS rather than loaded as an
 * asset so it renders at the same instant as the text beside it — this is the
 * element that tells someone the redirect landed where they expected, and it
